{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "709cf269c4ca5963348cc3297b133275fec305efb966580f192d1227f7250be6", "ja": "ランニングライブの打ち上げにやってきたメ\nンバー達。互いの頑張りを称え合いながら、\nスイーツと麦茶に舌鼓を打つ。元気を取り戻\nした一同は、次のライブへの期待を膨らませ\nるのだった。", "zh": "成员们来到了Running演唱会的庆功宴。\n大家互相赞扬彼此的努力，\n同时享受甜点与麦茶，大快朵颐。\n再次恢复精神的一行人，\n心中满怀对下一场演唱会的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ea2bd3dc5e7b54bcf7ceec53d7cfb9d8d9d3383de686d036751baa292959985d", "ja": "（ランニングライブを終えたメンバー達と、\n打ち上げにやってきた。疲れた時は、スイーツだな！）", "zh": "（我跟结束Running演唱会的成员们一起开庆功宴。\n疲劳的时候就是要吃甜点呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "9a0b4c933959b50eb31d4c716e2954a49e41b7d8e51858123096642f6a70e053", "ja": "今日は{$P$}がごちそうして\nくれるってことだけど……本当にいいんかい？", "zh": "今天{$P$}要请客……\n真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4a38d3a9682620e987e6118e9ecf75d5cfe356d28fce5d0e78cc76bb1cce6e14", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだよ！\nみんな、失ったカロリーを補給してくれ。", "zh": "嗯，当然了！\n大家要把消耗的卡路里补充回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "d6f12aa52d7668385ef625858752502945fb1f6d31c1ba3bb70753dc312c8b96", "ja": "よっしゃ～♪", "zh": "好耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "25057bca936ba5a7ab822cf4376ab93b2b2b6b8e15924e426b9f97ab8c3d3898", "ja": "わぁ～♪", "zh": "哇～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "07bc44a5ea0833b9bbf59c7ce954e75037036e030354f4ab687997f2ed4d79ac", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}くん。\n私達もお呼ばれしちゃって、よかったのかしら？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}。\n把我们也邀请过来，这样好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "7b48fb63cfa7a0401001bc084499ac50fb4fa01a887c35cf60d1584419e9f67f", "ja": "ワタシとリオ、ランニングライブは出てないヨ？\nずっと見てただけなのに、いいノ？", "zh": "我跟莉绪没有参加Running演唱会耶。\n只是在一旁看着而已，没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "581b2f4a10014404da5cd136eef630d99aac01615313c60097c3aba70079ca08", "ja": "ふたりとも、ランニングには参加してくれたからな。\nせっかくだからみんなで、打ち上げを楽しんでくれ！", "zh": "因为你们有来参加跑步啊。\n难得有这个机会，大家一起享受庆功宴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "f5683f9ace7dec8d52842899dff530bf446290a6c5e71810714077880c792548", "ja": "わーい♪", "zh": "耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "ba42d90e9b730b4935cd2365c66c6872e5f46add5718432bae90b3ce420d1121", "ja": "ワーイ！", "zh": "耶──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "a149f4454f162b9458e0092f4855f8dad3784b1fbf54ae448d103f980da7cb77", "ja": "それにしてもすごかったわねぇ、ランニングライブ。\n最後、みんなでゴールするところとか！", "zh": "话说回来，Running演唱会还真精彩呢。\n像是最后大家一起跑到终点那边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "db944aff9713d59d0d4d33fd3bd226c17df2b49c63d7e3cdc52231aec7fc210e", "ja": "だよネ、だよネ！\n見てたら、ワタシも出たかった～って思ったヨ～！", "zh": "就是啊、就是啊！\n看着看着，我都想参加了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "a310ee5173f64c1d14ac7475c2df5f069b2ce4c957bac9cc23af203fe39ce1e4", "ja": "そうなの、ホント感動しちゃって……うぅっ。\nあ、すみませーん！　ケーキセットおかわり～！", "zh": "没错，我真的好感动……呜呜！\n啊，不好意思──！再来一份蛋糕套餐～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "9c2ac85e0e0015d4174a7ffd01d60ca9ae303fde474af6ae3f27af05c33671f4", "ja": "あっ、ワタシも！\nクリームブリュレ、くださいナ～♪", "zh": "啊，我也要！\n请给我焦糖烤布蕾～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "480c01d6626d2ce1e14de5d9d35dbaa0b9c09b23f8c2a2fa789a0a59991cf91f", "ja": "私、ちょっと熱くなりすぎてしまって。\nうぅ、お恥ずかしいです……。", "zh": "我当时有点太激动了。\n呜呜，好难为情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "2c5730b1a94740715e715831a4bfff044f88847dfe89d81a405c942890970de3", "ja": "そんなことないって、エミリー！\nだいたい、おしとやかなだけが大和撫子ちゃうで！", "zh": "没那回事，艾蜜莉！\n本来大和抚子就不只有端庄贤淑呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "d3d32e43f6cdd0254df328c5974430960e4eb61957b7bfd39d74e11b309b1b00", "ja": "ランニングライブのエミリー、ほんまにカッコよかった\nと思うわ。なんちゅ～か……そう、凛としてて！", "zh": "我觉得Running演唱会上的艾蜜莉真的很帅气。\n该怎么形容……对了，英姿焕发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "fd8a87f212791f4accc0af300fd7b5a7c6395f6e69ba35c5f71c9d9bf7ff71ae", "ja": "まあ……！\n奈緒さんにそう言っていただけて、うれしいです♪", "zh": "哎呀……！\n能听到奈绪这么说，我好高兴♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "9e7ff93b3f8e0544572b584739f90d496714bc334ad148ce44b07742ac33e85c", "ja": "奈緒さんの言うとおりだべさ。\nエミリーちゃん、ほれぼれしたよぉ。", "zh": "奈绪说得没错哪。\n艾蜜莉的表现令人着迷哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "26575ce6095ffcee1f710492bd9c7c4dc6efd5132dbd67267a07d80d416f58c2", "ja": "ひなたさん……ありがとうございます♪\nさあ、私達も甘味をいただきましょう！", "zh": "日向……谢谢你♪\n来，我们也开始享用甜点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1021_omisenohito", "source_sha256": "584a92896a4cf33e660c3cc57f32105196255941889f94dc38919327457a1c16", "ja": "ご注文の品お持ちしました。ガトーショコラ、\nモンブラン、さつま芋のムース……。", "zh": "为您送上餐点，\n巧克力蛋糕、蒙布朗、地瓜慕斯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1022_omisenohito", "source_sha256": "69f52d9491a3cd59913de0814bb27dc3c77dfd4c7fff525aa4e1fde986a696bc", "ja": "チョコミントアイス、パンケーキ、生クリーム\nクレープ、ミルフィーユ……以上でお揃いでしょうか？", "zh": "薄荷巧克力冰淇淋、松饼、鲜奶油可丽饼、\n千层派……请问餐点都到齐了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "7a8335f15338ac1a42befa2716c70f2362caf3b4d57c65caeff46118efe85f7f", "ja": "はーい♪　……あ、あと追加で！　大盛りあんこパフェ\nお願いします！　それと、麦茶～。", "zh": "到齐了～♪啊，我要加点！\n我要大杯红豆圣代！还有麦茶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "78f7797c923287c2ee3ae4e173d4d45db4d714b03bd2ad34e8bc7ac652f4e749", "ja": "で、でしたら、私も！　抹茶氷菓盛り菓子を。\nあ、麦茶も……♪", "zh": "这、这样的话，我也要！请给我抹茶冰菓杯。\n啊，还有麦茶……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "257551b9c7d00a4408bbc2717969f23fdee2f0ee624b7ca7bc8cfed18e74045a", "ja": "あたしもいいかい？　白玉団子パフェと……。\n麦茶を、いただけるだろか。", "zh": "我也可以加点吗？\n我要白玉汤圆圣代跟……麦茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "81b555da4bc85e7d3b8de600d8dc78315397e12d3367e7bd2ff6bdee1251d9b1", "ja": "じゃあワタシも、メロンパフェひとつネ！\nあと、麦茶を！", "zh": "那我也要一个哈密瓜圣代！\n还有麦茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "83886763abdcdb713966c4f318ef5eb17b007bea56579fc89a096227ffc8c7e7", "ja": "じゃあ、私は～……この、ビターショコラパフェを\nお願いします。そ、れ、と……麦茶！", "zh": "那我要点……这个苦味巧克力圣代，\n还有……麦茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7c7834da242c0b3a0aebb7bb1f371549a82a96625d7d36a3c6cd892e99208b10", "ja": "あ、じゃあ……麦茶ください。\n麦茶だけで……。", "zh": "啊，那……请给我麦茶。\n只要麦茶就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "6be3d0b01d84a565bde5916df573e888fd80f259ccf0061a4441cba63a936a12", "ja": "（若いうちはよく食べ、よく運動し……それでいい。\n元気なみんなの顔が見られたら、満足だから）", "zh": "（趁年轻多吃多运动……这样很好。\n能看到大家充满活力的模样，我就满足了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "8a3b35bdf9cefd737a8bb161d82e9042782aca32b1405714649fe34a183937f3", "ja": "はぁ～、めっちゃ食べたわ～！\n{$P$}さん、ごちそうさまでした♪", "zh": "呼～吃了好多啊～！\n{$P$}先生，谢谢招待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "3bf1e4bdc9a446ea2e7fc4523279afcc1f2c1d9b19d8a7f4d676f96600fa5d39", "ja": "本当によく食べたな……\nというか、みんなどこに入ったんだ……？", "zh": "大家真的很会吃……\n应该说，吃下去的东西都到哪了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "f20e51dc0dd9fa04adc67296aa5f613cd947442bdcfedf16116ece76641174e4", "ja": "それは乙女の秘密です！\nなあなあ、それより{$P$}さん。", "zh": "这是少女的秘密！\n欸欸，先不说这个，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1035_037nao", "source_sha256": "fed762b3fe7577286ab2223cfa7dc8e5022dbebd053116203abfccb3f8973eb1", "ja": "ランニングライブ、自分で言うといてなんですけど、\n無謀なんちゃうかなって思ったりもしたんです。", "zh": "虽然是我自己提出要办Running演唱会的，\n但我其实也有想过是不是太乱来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "c8bc4de9876a87c6a6b08f42b0ebab56f9e01f28b9c011d1e179b22a12ee20cc", "ja": "奈緒……。", "zh": "奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1037_037nao", "source_sha256": "99730c04fd70b474a0660d5125342f6d277394c91ddb34e2f8cc93f24bf6f910", "ja": "でも{$P$}さんがサポートしてくれて\nみんなも練習がんばってくれて、実現できて……。", "zh": "不过多亏{$P$}先生协助，\n大家也努力练习，最后才能成功实现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "5c1df9d4131d300a21f1bdcdb9f573766e912d26874b4c218b3fde5899debb5c", "ja": "お客さんも、私が想像してたんより、\nずっとずっとずっと、めーっちゃ盛り上がってくれて！", "zh": "观众们的反应，\n也比我想像得更加更加更加～热烈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "64850b4a692f2110dc184a6e5c0d9c3715b0f32a45d8a504ed043b2eb6089c72", "ja": "えへっ、チャレンジさせてくれて、\nほんまにありがとう！　私、ほんまに楽しかったです！", "zh": "嘿嘿，真的很谢谢你让我挑战！\n我真的很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1040_p", "source_sha256": "d866d5647ba0fcaf1918286c414f016ee89c7dd45427dbfd0e07481e0eb62741", "ja": "……ああ、こちらこそ！\nまた次のライブも、楽しいライブにしような！", "zh": "……不，我才要谢谢你！\n我们下次也要一起举办开心的演唱会喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1041_037nao", "source_sha256": "e5ae428f7928c1b4956f660a6127c5772c1508a891d4de52cf8e02ce512edb99", "ja": "はい！　またよろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "好的！之后也请多指教了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1042_p", "source_sha256": "8c8e5b6c2804331c88781091693c20aff0860a1c6541a4e23c1e3ceb6891f67a", "ja": "（今回のランニングライブ。奈緒は自分で考えて\n実行した事で、色々得た物があったみたいだ）", "zh": "（奈绪自己构思并执行了这次的Running演唱会，\n她似乎从这个过程得到了许多收获。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "1be89d1b11da5e166c4f046648eca7fb8169bec231caee0033e718f8dc380ba3", "ja": "（次のライブも、今回以上に盛り上げたいな。\n……さて、帰りにもやしを買わなきゃ）", "zh": "（真希望下一场演唱会能比这次更加热闹。\n……好了，回家路上得去买豆芽菜才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
